{"2791720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heat or Die", "steam_appid": 2791720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You're lost in a vast forest — but your partner is firing flares to guide you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/05ee9ecf9ccec497c50ab4910e5de348.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert — it’s easy to get lost in the vast woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll face many challenges — the cold and the Wendigo are waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/8a752b2a67e5c5a1a1684d71ac616b1f.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire is your only friend — and the Wendigo's enemy. But unfortunately, it doesn’t last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your torch is out, loot matches to reignite campfires. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campfires not only keep you warm — they reignite your torch and your chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/67ec7945cbe7f5f3c1759ee42b637a26.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/67ec7945cbe7f5f3c1759ee42b637a26.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/67ec7945cbe7f5f3c1759ee42b637a26.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the torch goes out, stay quiet… or he'll hear you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.poster.avif?t=1753953939\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.webm?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/d61635b04c93b11bac39d3c9cd4b5185.mp4?t=1753953939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too long without heat, and the cold kills you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out here, there are no second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791720/extras/11f758d091449582b6937721ac734cbf.poster.avif?